WEBVTT

00:00:06.006 --> 00:00:09.926
A NETFLIX SERIES

00:00:19.853 --> 00:00:22.689
KOTARO LIVES ALONE

00:01:15.075 --> 00:01:16.618
Kotaro.

00:01:16.701 --> 00:01:17.535
Huh?

00:01:17.619 --> 00:01:18.912
Lady Kana.

00:01:18.995 --> 00:01:22.082
I'll play with you later, Kotaro.

00:01:22.165 --> 00:01:22.999
Oh?

00:01:23.083 --> 00:01:24.501
Oh, Mr. Karino.

00:01:25.543 --> 00:01:26.753
Good afternoon.

00:01:26.836 --> 00:01:28.838
I'm Kana's mother, Sawaguchi.

00:01:28.922 --> 00:01:30.048
Oh, hello.

00:01:30.131 --> 00:01:31.549
Well…

00:01:31.633 --> 00:01:35.678
Kana says she wants to play
at Kotaro's house.

00:01:35.762 --> 00:01:36.721
Is that alright?

00:01:36.805 --> 00:01:38.556
Oh, well…

00:01:38.640 --> 00:01:40.892
I don't have a problem with that.

00:01:40.975 --> 00:01:42.102
What he said.

00:01:42.185 --> 00:01:44.854
Then, thank you. I leave her to you.

00:01:45.438 --> 00:01:47.982
Kana, I'll come get you tonight.

00:01:50.944 --> 00:01:52.070
Hey, did you hear?

00:01:59.828 --> 00:02:02.080
Huh? What's up with this silence?

00:02:02.580 --> 00:02:07.794
Are you two good friends in kindergarten?

00:02:08.753 --> 00:02:09.879
Not really.

00:02:09.963 --> 00:02:10.964
I see…

00:02:11.047 --> 00:02:14.717
But I know a little bit about Kotaro.

00:02:15.301 --> 00:02:18.638
So Kotaro, what can we play with
at your house?

00:02:18.721 --> 00:02:20.765
Do you not want to play outside?

00:02:20.849 --> 00:02:22.851
No way! It's really cold outside.

00:02:23.768 --> 00:02:25.353
KOTARO SATO

00:02:28.148 --> 00:02:31.734
Why is Kana trying to play with him?

00:02:31.818 --> 00:02:35.488
By the way,
why are you here as well, Sir Karino?

00:02:35.572 --> 00:02:36.698
Well,

00:02:36.781 --> 00:02:40.034
Kana's mom left me to you guys.
That's why.

00:02:40.118 --> 00:02:43.079
More importantly, isn't there something
more exciting to do?

00:02:43.163 --> 00:02:44.330
Let's see…

00:02:53.506 --> 00:02:55.383
Okay, how about cards?

00:02:55.466 --> 00:02:57.635
Yes! Okay, let's do that.

00:02:57.719 --> 00:02:59.179
How about we play Old Maid?

00:02:59.262 --> 00:03:00.138
Sure.

00:03:00.680 --> 00:03:03.057
THE NEXT DAY

00:03:03.141 --> 00:03:06.769
Kana says she wants to
come over again today. Is that okay?

00:03:06.853 --> 00:03:07.770
Okay…

00:03:07.854 --> 00:03:08.688
It is fine.

00:03:10.648 --> 00:03:14.068
Kotaro, make sure
Kana has fun today, okay?

00:03:14.152 --> 00:03:14.986
Huh?

00:03:15.069 --> 00:03:17.197
We played Old Maid forever yesterday.

00:03:17.947 --> 00:03:20.325
I've never been so unexcited before.

00:03:20.408 --> 00:03:24.787
You're right,
it's not that fun playing with Kotaro.

00:03:24.871 --> 00:03:26.289
There's nothing to do.

00:03:26.372 --> 00:03:28.041
Hey, she's talking about you.

00:03:28.124 --> 00:03:30.168
Well, yes.

00:03:30.251 --> 00:03:34.172
Even though I am quite skilled
at entertaining adult women…

00:03:34.255 --> 00:03:35.465
For real?

00:03:36.841 --> 00:03:38.635
May she play with Kotaro today?

00:03:39.260 --> 00:03:40.094
Today as well?

00:03:40.887 --> 00:03:43.097
Kana says she also wants to play today,

00:03:43.181 --> 00:03:44.807
so may she go with Kotaro?

00:03:44.891 --> 00:03:46.309
I don't get it.

00:03:46.392 --> 00:03:49.729
Kana said it wasn't fun
playing with him, right?

00:03:51.898 --> 00:03:55.151
Lady Kana. I am basically
fine with you playing with me,

00:03:55.235 --> 00:04:00.240
but would it not be more fun
to play with people other than me?

00:04:01.324 --> 00:04:05.912
There are other people you play with a lot
during recess at kindergarten.

00:04:06.996 --> 00:04:10.083
It's okay. I'll play with you, Kotaro.

00:04:10.625 --> 00:04:12.085
Mama said to do that too.

00:04:12.168 --> 00:04:13.002
Oh…

00:04:15.296 --> 00:04:17.924
Kana, I'll come get you this evening.

00:04:19.842 --> 00:04:21.344
Hey, did you hear?

00:04:21.427 --> 00:04:25.014
Kana's father's company went bankrupt.

00:04:25.098 --> 00:04:28.559
What? The family finances
must be in ruins. What a pity.

00:04:33.398 --> 00:04:34.565
Ms. Sawaguchi.

00:04:35.441 --> 00:04:37.026
Could I talk with you for a bit?

00:04:37.110 --> 00:04:38.569
Okay.

00:04:38.653 --> 00:04:43.157
Could you be a little more considerate
of that kid's feelings?

00:04:43.241 --> 00:04:44.158
What?

00:04:44.242 --> 00:04:46.286
You're having Kana play with him

00:04:46.369 --> 00:04:49.539
because you don't want her
to play at homes

00:04:49.622 --> 00:04:51.457
that are better off than you, right?

00:04:52.208 --> 00:04:56.004
Ms. Sawaguchi, I don't know
how you see Kotaro,

00:04:56.754 --> 00:04:58.047
but he is who he is,

00:04:58.131 --> 00:05:00.258
and he's doing his best living here.

00:05:00.800 --> 00:05:02.427
Having her play here for that--

00:05:02.510 --> 00:05:05.847
What are you saying?
You make it sound like

00:05:06.514 --> 00:05:10.184
I'm just using Kotaro's circumstances
for my own benefit.

00:05:11.311 --> 00:05:12.478
That's not…

00:05:13.688 --> 00:05:14.939
Right?

00:05:15.023 --> 00:05:18.359
Because that would make me pretty upset.

00:05:23.781 --> 00:05:24.824
Hey, Kana.

00:05:25.450 --> 00:05:27.785
Do you have fun playing with Kotaro?

00:05:27.869 --> 00:05:30.079
No, not really.

00:05:30.747 --> 00:05:32.498
- But it's okay.
- Huh?

00:05:33.082 --> 00:05:35.668
I mean, when I play with Kotaro,

00:05:35.752 --> 00:05:38.212
you look relieved and happy, right?

00:05:43.926 --> 00:05:45.136
- I'm sorry.
- Huh?

00:05:45.928 --> 00:05:47.638
I'm sorry, Kana.

00:05:52.185 --> 00:05:53.644
Have a look at this.

00:05:53.728 --> 00:05:55.688
It's a handmade sugoroku game.

00:05:55.772 --> 00:05:58.441
Kana can't say it's not fun
at my house if we've this.

00:05:58.524 --> 00:06:01.527
You sure are commendable,
or something like that.

00:06:10.620 --> 00:06:13.539
What have you been doing?
Is that shadow boxing?

00:06:13.623 --> 00:06:15.666
You're full of energy in the morning.

00:06:15.750 --> 00:06:18.252
Yes. I am always energetic.

00:06:19.253 --> 00:06:22.465
The reason is because, I am strong!

00:06:23.049 --> 00:06:25.385
He wants to be loved by his father,

00:06:25.468 --> 00:06:27.637
so he's trying to become stronger.

00:06:29.764 --> 00:06:32.308
Alright, we'll read a picture book now.

00:06:32.392 --> 00:06:33.643
Okay!

00:06:33.726 --> 00:06:35.561
Teacher.

00:06:35.645 --> 00:06:37.271
What's wrong, Kei?

00:06:37.355 --> 00:06:39.899
I'm feeling a little sick.

00:06:39.982 --> 00:06:42.527
What? Maybe you have a fever?

00:06:42.610 --> 00:06:45.238
Let's take you to the nurse's office
and call your mom.

00:06:48.282 --> 00:06:50.993
Kei seems to get sick a lot, right?

00:06:51.077 --> 00:06:53.329
He got a fever the other day too.

00:06:53.413 --> 00:06:54.705
Come over here!

00:06:54.789 --> 00:06:55.748
Wait for me!

00:06:55.832 --> 00:06:57.667
- Kotaro?
- Sir Kei.

00:06:58.251 --> 00:07:00.503
This was the dessert in my bento,

00:07:00.586 --> 00:07:02.630
- but you can have it.
- Huh?

00:07:02.713 --> 00:07:05.633
It's no good for you to be weak
by catching things like colds!

00:07:05.716 --> 00:07:07.260
You need to take vitamins.

00:07:07.343 --> 00:07:08.678
Are we clear?

00:07:08.761 --> 00:07:12.515
It's good if you become a strong person
who doesn't get colds, like me!

00:07:13.307 --> 00:07:15.435
THE NEXT DAY

00:07:16.853 --> 00:07:20.481
Kotaro. Could it be that you're sick?

00:07:21.524 --> 00:07:25.903
What are you saying, Lady Teacher?
I am in great shape.

00:07:26.696 --> 00:07:29.073
See? Your forehead is so hot.

00:07:29.157 --> 00:07:32.285
Isn't there a problem
with your hand, Lady Teacher?

00:07:32.368 --> 00:07:33.995
I am not hot at all.

00:07:34.078 --> 00:07:35.246
No, that isn't the case--

00:07:35.329 --> 00:07:37.331
I do not have a cold!

00:07:37.415 --> 00:07:40.334
No! It'll get worse if you run around!

00:07:40.418 --> 00:07:42.962
Anyways, let's go
to the nurse's office, Kotaro!

00:07:43.045 --> 00:07:44.464
I will not go!

00:07:44.547 --> 00:07:46.132
I do not need to go.

00:07:46.757 --> 00:07:49.635
I do not have a cold!

00:07:51.679 --> 00:07:54.557
Kotaro clearly has a fever.

00:07:55.057 --> 00:07:57.768
So I called you, Mr. Karino.

00:07:58.394 --> 00:08:01.981
You were sweating yesterday morning
and went to kindergarten as is, huh?

00:08:02.064 --> 00:08:03.524
That's why you caught a cold.

00:08:03.608 --> 00:08:06.611
I did not go as is.
I don't have a cold either.

00:08:06.694 --> 00:08:07.820
Liar.

00:08:07.904 --> 00:08:09.947
Whatever, let's hurry home.

00:08:10.031 --> 00:08:12.950
I need to become strong.

00:08:13.034 --> 00:08:15.203
Therefore, I do not have a cold.

00:08:15.286 --> 00:08:17.580
How can I convince him?

00:08:18.331 --> 00:08:19.874
Teacher.

00:08:19.957 --> 00:08:22.668
I started feeling sick again.

00:08:22.752 --> 00:08:25.213
Oh no. Well, let's go the nurse's office.

00:08:29.300 --> 00:08:31.135
- Sir Kei.
- Yes?

00:08:31.719 --> 00:08:35.848
Why do you admit to being sick so easily?

00:08:35.932 --> 00:08:40.102
Are you okay with everyone thinking
that you're weak?

00:08:42.021 --> 00:08:45.358
I really want to play with everyone.

00:08:46.025 --> 00:08:49.862
But I'm not as strong as everyone else,

00:08:49.946 --> 00:08:51.906
so I get colds more easily.

00:08:52.490 --> 00:08:55.910
For me, I'm sadder
if I spread my cold to everyone

00:08:55.993 --> 00:08:59.205
than not being able to play with them.

00:09:01.207 --> 00:09:03.918
That's why I am okay
with waiting to play until I'm better.

00:09:10.341 --> 00:09:11.551
- I am sorry.
- Huh?

00:09:11.634 --> 00:09:14.387
I apologize for calling you weak.

00:09:14.971 --> 00:09:17.765
Sir Kei, you are a strong person.

00:09:19.475 --> 00:09:21.519
Thanks. That makes me happy!

00:09:24.146 --> 00:09:25.189
Sir Karino.

00:09:25.773 --> 00:09:28.859
It looks like I still need
a fair amount of training.

00:09:30.069 --> 00:09:31.654
If that cold still bothers you,

00:09:31.737 --> 00:09:33.698
I can carry you home.

00:09:35.658 --> 00:09:37.368
Why did we buy a box?

00:09:37.451 --> 00:09:40.955
I will take a lot of vitamins
and get over my cold quickly.

00:09:46.002 --> 00:09:50.006
GOING TO A VIEWING/YOU TOO?!

00:09:50.715 --> 00:09:52.216
Good morning!

00:09:52.300 --> 00:09:53.551
What's going on?

00:09:53.634 --> 00:09:56.554
Today isn't the day you give me
my living stipend.

00:09:56.637 --> 00:09:58.848
I came today because of a request!

00:09:58.931 --> 00:10:01.809
Please accompany me for the day today!

00:10:01.892 --> 00:10:04.979
Alright! Since we have a reservation,
get ready to head out!

00:10:05.855 --> 00:10:08.107
What on earth is going on?

00:10:11.527 --> 00:10:13.195
An apartment viewing?

00:10:13.279 --> 00:10:15.823
Yes! I, the attorney, Kobayashi,

00:10:15.906 --> 00:10:17.491
have saved some money

00:10:17.575 --> 00:10:20.703
and plan on spending it
to buy this apartment!

00:10:20.786 --> 00:10:24.373
However, I was unsure about
going to an apartment viewing by myself,

00:10:24.457 --> 00:10:27.501
so, I want to go with you, Mr. Sato,
as you're a specialist

00:10:27.585 --> 00:10:29.712
when it comes to living on your own!

00:10:29.795 --> 00:10:32.757
Lady Kobayashi,
you don't need to yell on the train.

00:10:32.840 --> 00:10:34.175
- Okay!
- Yes.

00:10:34.258 --> 00:10:37.011
If that's the case,
you can leave it to me.

00:10:37.094 --> 00:10:38.554
Thank you very much!

00:10:38.638 --> 00:10:40.640
I said, you are being loud.

00:10:41.223 --> 00:10:45.394
Well, this is Room 305
of Sanien Apartments.

00:10:45.478 --> 00:10:46.312
Okay!

00:10:47.605 --> 00:10:48.648
What's wrong?!

00:10:50.691 --> 00:10:52.777
Checking the outside is also important.

00:10:52.860 --> 00:10:54.737
I see, good to know!

00:10:54.820 --> 00:10:56.030
Well then, let's go.

00:11:00.826 --> 00:11:03.913
This property was just listed for sale
the other day.

00:11:03.996 --> 00:11:06.916
There have been lots of
viewing reservations. It's popular.

00:11:06.999 --> 00:11:08.668
Yes! I am aware of this!

00:11:08.751 --> 00:11:11.629
- Please feel free to look around.
- Okay!

00:11:13.089 --> 00:11:13.923
Mr. Sato,

00:11:14.006 --> 00:11:17.009
I've brought various props
for this viewing!

00:11:17.093 --> 00:11:18.511
For now, right here!

00:11:19.136 --> 00:11:22.139
I have a table and TV
to make this look like a living room!

00:11:22.223 --> 00:11:24.725
A futon and pillows for the bedroom!

00:11:24.809 --> 00:11:27.269
A bath set for the bathroom!

00:11:27.353 --> 00:11:29.980
Using these props,
we can feel like we actually live here

00:11:30.064 --> 00:11:32.191
and know what the rooms are like!

00:11:32.775 --> 00:11:34.068
What do you think, Mr. Sato?

00:11:34.151 --> 00:11:36.028
Yes. It is not bad.

00:11:36.112 --> 00:11:38.030
Huh? He doesn't look too happy.

00:11:38.114 --> 00:11:40.866
Maybe it was bad
to bring him here after all?

00:11:40.950 --> 00:11:44.078
Apartment viewing? With Kotaro?

00:11:44.161 --> 00:11:46.580
Yes, it was just put on sale.

00:11:46.664 --> 00:11:48.624
Now's our only chance.

00:11:48.708 --> 00:11:51.794
You seem fired up about this.
Which apartment is it?

00:11:51.877 --> 00:11:55.214
Room 305 in the Sanien Apartments.

00:11:55.297 --> 00:11:56.924
Isn't that building…

00:11:57.007 --> 00:12:01.470
Yes, it's the room Kotaro lived in
with his parents.

00:12:02.430 --> 00:12:03.931
Lady Kobayashi.

00:12:04.014 --> 00:12:07.727
You read my diary entries
to this kind person, yes?

00:12:07.810 --> 00:12:11.981
Oh, I'm sorry.
I thought that it'd be okay.

00:12:13.315 --> 00:12:14.692
But Kobayashi,

00:12:14.775 --> 00:12:18.904
Kotaro probably has more painful memories

00:12:18.988 --> 00:12:21.699
than good ones in that room.

00:12:21.782 --> 00:12:23.242
You must know that.

00:12:23.325 --> 00:12:26.537
I was thinking that as well. But…

00:12:27.747 --> 00:12:31.876
On October 15,
I found a strangely shaped stain

00:12:31.959 --> 00:12:34.462
on the ceiling of my room.

00:12:36.964 --> 00:12:40.259
I remember there was a similar mark
somewhere in the place

00:12:40.342 --> 00:12:42.845
I lived with my mother and father.

00:12:43.971 --> 00:12:46.640
I wonder how that place is now.

00:12:47.850 --> 00:12:51.562
It would be nice if the place we lived in
was still doing well.

00:12:56.233 --> 00:12:58.402
We're almost out of time.

00:12:58.486 --> 00:12:59.820
Oh, okay!

00:12:59.904 --> 00:13:02.573
Hey little boy, I hope it's okay
if we finish…

00:13:11.540 --> 00:13:12.583
Huh?

00:13:12.666 --> 00:13:15.169
I'm sorry.
Could you give us some more time?

00:13:15.252 --> 00:13:17.922
Just a little more time to view it.

00:13:21.675 --> 00:13:23.010
I won't buy it though.

00:13:23.093 --> 00:13:23.928
What?!

00:13:33.062 --> 00:13:35.564
Are you looking for foliage to eat too?

00:13:35.648 --> 00:13:38.984
Yes. A lot of them
can be found in this area.

00:13:39.068 --> 00:13:40.277
Big brother!

00:13:40.361 --> 00:13:41.737
I'm hungry!

00:13:41.821 --> 00:13:44.281
Wait a bit. I'll start searching.

00:13:44.365 --> 00:13:47.868
If I may ask,
why are you wearing beach sandals?

00:13:47.952 --> 00:13:49.870
Aren't those cold for this season?

00:13:49.954 --> 00:13:52.164
My shoes are too small and don't fit,

00:13:52.248 --> 00:13:55.167
we have no money,
and this is all I have to wear.

00:13:55.251 --> 00:13:56.418
I see.

00:13:56.502 --> 00:13:59.922
You don't have money either?
Is that why you're eating these grasses?

00:14:00.005 --> 00:14:03.759
It's not that I don't have money,
but I can save on food this way.

00:14:04.468 --> 00:14:06.762
Did your mom tell you
to forage for grasses?

00:14:06.846 --> 00:14:10.099
No. I live by myself.

00:14:10.182 --> 00:14:12.852
Neither my father nor mother are with me.

00:14:13.561 --> 00:14:15.354
Big Brother, I want food!

00:14:15.437 --> 00:14:16.605
Food!

00:14:16.689 --> 00:14:17.857
We're the same.

00:14:19.650 --> 00:14:22.528
Can you look after
my brother and sister for a bit?

00:14:22.611 --> 00:14:24.613
- Huh?
- I have something to do.

00:14:24.697 --> 00:14:27.950
That is fine,
but should we just stay here?

00:14:28.033 --> 00:14:28.868
Yeah.

00:14:31.328 --> 00:14:32.955
2 HOURS LATER

00:14:33.038 --> 00:14:35.958
Big Brother!

00:14:36.041 --> 00:14:37.668
He just won't come back.

00:14:37.751 --> 00:14:40.754
If we don't get out of here soon,
it will be dark.

00:14:40.838 --> 00:14:43.007
Do you two know where you live?

00:14:51.807 --> 00:14:57.062
Brother! You have snacks!

00:14:57.146 --> 00:14:58.939
Was that what you had to do?

00:14:59.023 --> 00:15:00.399
It doesn't really matter.

00:15:01.233 --> 00:15:05.988
There are times when I don't want to think
about my little brother and sister.

00:15:06.071 --> 00:15:09.992
However, they were crying
when you were not there.

00:15:10.075 --> 00:15:13.120
That's life. Mom won't come home.

00:15:14.830 --> 00:15:17.249
Dad went off with another woman,

00:15:17.333 --> 00:15:19.501
Mom left us a little bit of money

00:15:19.585 --> 00:15:21.337
and hasn't been back.

00:15:22.004 --> 00:15:25.049
But she said, "You're the older brother,

00:15:25.132 --> 00:15:28.886
so look after
your younger brother and sister."

00:15:28.969 --> 00:15:32.348
Why did you ignore
what your mother told you to do?

00:15:32.848 --> 00:15:35.017
You must keep that promise.

00:15:36.644 --> 00:15:40.439
What the heck? I thought you'd get it
since you're like me.

00:15:40.522 --> 00:15:41.523
The same?

00:15:41.607 --> 00:15:45.653
Yeah! We were both abandoned
by our moms!

00:15:45.736 --> 00:15:47.571
Wrong! We were not abandoned!

00:15:47.655 --> 00:15:48.739
We were abandoned!

00:15:48.822 --> 00:15:51.450
We definitely were not abandoned!

00:15:51.533 --> 00:15:53.953
We were not abandoned!

00:15:54.036 --> 00:15:56.205
Enough! I'm going home.

00:16:04.046 --> 00:16:08.300
Listen. Mommy won't be
with Daddy anymore, okay?

00:16:16.266 --> 00:16:17.768
Are you going out?

00:16:18.519 --> 00:16:19.353
Listen.

00:16:21.355 --> 00:16:25.025
Even if I'm not around,
take care of yourself, okay?

00:16:25.109 --> 00:16:27.319
If you do that, I will come home.

00:16:28.112 --> 00:16:29.405
Do you understand?

00:16:29.488 --> 00:16:30.364
Yes.

00:16:30.447 --> 00:16:32.950
So, be sure to…

00:16:35.536 --> 00:16:37.079
continue living.

00:16:38.664 --> 00:16:41.542
SEVERAL DAYS LATER

00:16:42.543 --> 00:16:45.754
Did you hear about the three siblings
in this building?

00:16:45.838 --> 00:16:48.048
They were taken by child services.

00:16:48.132 --> 00:16:51.135
The parents hadn't come home
for a long time, right?

00:16:51.218 --> 00:16:54.221
Those kids were abandoned, huh?

00:16:54.304 --> 00:16:55.597
How awful.

00:16:56.557 --> 00:16:58.475
They were not abandoned…

00:17:04.440 --> 00:17:06.859
Won't you damage the futon
by hitting it so much?

00:17:07.943 --> 00:17:10.988
If it isn't Sir Karino! Good day to you!

00:17:11.071 --> 00:17:14.491
You're really fired up.
Did something good happen?

00:17:15.951 --> 00:17:19.038
Not really! I am just living my best life!

00:17:24.585 --> 00:17:25.711
Yum!

00:17:25.794 --> 00:17:27.671
It's delicious!

00:17:27.755 --> 00:17:29.965
They are treats from the landlords.

00:17:30.049 --> 00:17:32.843
I got them as a thank you gift
for watching their place.

00:17:32.926 --> 00:17:35.220
I've never had anything this delicious!

00:17:35.304 --> 00:17:37.264
Thank you, Kotaro!

00:17:37.347 --> 00:17:39.600
These are thanks for the daifuku earlier.

00:17:39.683 --> 00:17:42.144
Sorry to keep you waiting.
This is green tea.

00:17:43.479 --> 00:17:47.232
Warm green tea is the best
with Japanese sweets.

00:17:48.317 --> 00:17:51.695
Yeah! It enhances the sweetness, right?

00:17:53.947 --> 00:17:57.868
So, why are you in my room, Sir Karino?
I didn't invite you.

00:17:57.951 --> 00:17:59.286
That's right!

00:17:59.369 --> 00:18:03.373
Well, I take care of you quite a bit,
so why can't I stay?

00:18:03.457 --> 00:18:06.627
I did not ask you to take care of me.

00:18:07.878 --> 00:18:10.923
But just the two of us
can't eat all of this.

00:18:11.006 --> 00:18:13.092
Maybe it's fine to have Karino sometimes?

00:18:13.175 --> 00:18:14.676
Right?

00:18:14.760 --> 00:18:17.221
I'll bring some to Sir Tamaru later too.

00:18:17.304 --> 00:18:18.597
Oh, that's good.

00:18:18.680 --> 00:18:21.183
Mr. Tamaru might cry tears of joy.

00:18:21.266 --> 00:18:22.684
That's true.

00:18:23.477 --> 00:18:25.312
- Where are your manners?
- Oh.

00:18:25.395 --> 00:18:28.440
Manga artists need to keep up
with current news, you know.

00:18:29.191 --> 00:18:32.069
I WAS WRONG
MEET WITH ME. I WANT TO TALK.

00:18:34.613 --> 00:18:35.781
DELETE MESSAGE?

00:18:35.864 --> 00:18:37.616
This anime has finally become a movie!

00:18:37.699 --> 00:18:39.493
Tonosaman The Movie!

00:18:39.576 --> 00:18:41.328
The Return of Tonosaman!

00:18:41.411 --> 00:18:44.331
Do not go to the Terakoya
without breakfast!

00:18:44.915 --> 00:18:47.835
You must do your homework!

00:18:47.918 --> 00:18:51.171
Children should run around energetically!

00:18:51.255 --> 00:18:54.466
Help me, Tonosaman!

00:19:03.892 --> 00:19:05.435
We've kept you waiting!

00:19:05.519 --> 00:19:09.523
Tonosaman The Movie!
The Return of Tonosaman!

00:19:14.069 --> 00:19:16.697
You can collect Tonosaman cards
at theaters!

00:19:17.197 --> 00:19:18.073
Tonosaman!

00:19:18.824 --> 00:19:21.076
They're making this into a movie?

00:19:21.702 --> 00:19:22.995
Amazing!

00:19:24.204 --> 00:19:26.373
Kotaro, you like it that much?

00:19:26.456 --> 00:19:30.335
Yes! Since I strive
to become like Tonosaman.

00:19:30.419 --> 00:19:32.254
I want to emulate

00:19:32.337 --> 00:19:35.924
that unyielding iron will
and unbeatable strong heart.

00:19:36.008 --> 00:19:38.927
I need to become strong like Tonosaman!

00:19:40.888 --> 00:19:42.931
Don't swing that here, it's dangerous.

00:19:43.765 --> 00:19:45.934
Stronger, huh…

00:19:46.018 --> 00:19:47.186
I said watch out!

00:19:51.398 --> 00:19:52.733
Hey, Mizuki!

00:19:59.656 --> 00:20:01.408
Kotaro, welcome back!

00:20:02.701 --> 00:20:05.704
Lady Mizuki, what happened to your cheek?

00:20:06.413 --> 00:20:07.414
Cheek?

00:20:10.209 --> 00:20:12.836
I can't win with you, Kotaro.

00:20:13.754 --> 00:20:15.297
What, your boyfriend?

00:20:15.380 --> 00:20:17.925
The other day,
I tried breaking up with him.

00:20:18.592 --> 00:20:20.427
But he just wouldn't accept it.

00:20:21.261 --> 00:20:25.933
I wanted some distance, but he waited
at my club and in front of the apartment.

00:20:26.600 --> 00:20:27.476
Seriously?

00:20:28.143 --> 00:20:30.729
Then yesterday, he hit my face.

00:20:33.023 --> 00:20:36.318
I really should've
broken up with him sooner…

00:20:37.069 --> 00:20:39.029
Ever since we started dating,

00:20:39.655 --> 00:20:42.032
I knew he was after my money,

00:20:42.115 --> 00:20:44.076
and he showed violent tendencies.

00:20:44.952 --> 00:20:47.579
I knew I couldn't keep going like that,

00:20:47.663 --> 00:20:49.081
but I couldn't say anything.

00:20:50.123 --> 00:20:51.166
Ms. Mizuki.

00:20:51.250 --> 00:20:54.336
If you've endured that much,
you should tell the police.

00:20:54.836 --> 00:20:56.880
In any case, I can speak to them for you.

00:20:56.964 --> 00:20:59.800
Or I can beat him to a bloody pulp.

00:20:59.883 --> 00:21:02.094
Mr. Tamaru, when did you get here?

00:21:02.177 --> 00:21:05.055
And "beating him to a pulp"
would not be okay.

00:21:05.138 --> 00:21:07.099
- Huh?!
- Lady Mizuki.

00:21:07.182 --> 00:21:09.226
You need to get out of this apartment.

00:21:09.309 --> 00:21:10.185
What?

00:21:10.269 --> 00:21:12.437
Huh? What are you saying?

00:21:12.521 --> 00:21:15.691
Your boyfriend knows
where this apartment is, right?

00:21:15.774 --> 00:21:18.944
If so, you need to stop living here,
quit your job,

00:21:19.027 --> 00:21:21.863
and move to a place
where he can't find you.

00:21:21.947 --> 00:21:24.950
But I said I'd live with you here--

00:21:25.033 --> 00:21:27.160
- You can't.
- No, Kotaro,

00:21:27.244 --> 00:21:30.247
I think it'd be more effective
to restrict that guy.

00:21:30.330 --> 00:21:32.499
He's the bad guy,
so let's tell the police--

00:21:32.582 --> 00:21:34.001
If I say no, I mean it.

00:21:34.084 --> 00:21:37.379
You need to get out quickly
before it gets worse.

00:21:38.213 --> 00:21:40.048
Seriously, that kid…

00:21:44.386 --> 00:21:45.262
Yes?

00:21:46.096 --> 00:21:47.472
Kotaro?

00:21:50.017 --> 00:21:51.893
10 MINUTES LATER

00:21:55.022 --> 00:21:56.648
ANOTHER 10 MINUTES LATER

00:21:59.818 --> 00:22:01.194
10 MINUTES AFTER THAT

00:22:01.278 --> 00:22:02.487
Kotaro!

00:22:05.532 --> 00:22:09.953
You want me to get out so badly
that you'll bother me like this all day?

00:22:10.454 --> 00:22:13.290
I wouldn't have to leave
if, like Karino said,

00:22:14.124 --> 00:22:15.709
I tell the police.

00:22:15.792 --> 00:22:17.586
No, Lady Mizuki.

00:22:17.669 --> 00:22:21.006
Then someone you love
will become the bad guy.

00:22:22.049 --> 00:22:26.720
It looks to me like you still
love your boyfriend, Lady Mizuki.

00:22:26.803 --> 00:22:29.723
You need to break up with him,

00:22:29.806 --> 00:22:32.434
but you do not want him
to be a bad guy, right?

00:22:33.226 --> 00:22:36.813
I made my father into a bad guy.

00:22:37.731 --> 00:22:41.109
You can not become like me, Lady Mizuki.

00:22:46.865 --> 00:22:50.494
I had happy memories with him too.

00:22:52.287 --> 00:22:53.538
Yes.

00:22:54.623 --> 00:22:55.791
I understand.

00:23:01.797 --> 00:23:04.841
You're really leaving, Ms. Mizuki?

00:23:05.425 --> 00:23:06.760
Thanks for everything.

00:23:06.843 --> 00:23:08.136
Be well!

00:23:08.762 --> 00:23:11.098
Why are you wearing a mask?

00:23:12.224 --> 00:23:13.558
Do not worry about it.

00:23:14.684 --> 00:23:15.977
Hey, Kotaro.

00:23:16.937 --> 00:23:20.565
I don't think what you did
to your father was wrong.

00:23:20.649 --> 00:23:24.820
I think it was
for your and your father's benefit.

00:23:25.737 --> 00:23:29.116
That's why I told the police
about my boyfriend.

00:23:30.075 --> 00:23:31.868
So, you don't need to leave.

00:23:32.494 --> 00:23:33.453
No.

00:23:34.121 --> 00:23:35.831
He didn't get arrested,

00:23:35.914 --> 00:23:38.333
so I don't know when he'll come again.

00:23:39.418 --> 00:23:41.628
I do need to
leave the apartment after all.

00:23:46.216 --> 00:23:47.843
I'm sorry, Kotaro.

00:23:48.552 --> 00:23:51.304
I couldn't keep the promise of
being together forever.

00:23:52.848 --> 00:23:54.057
I have forgotten

00:23:55.267 --> 00:23:56.518
such a promise.

00:24:22.836 --> 00:24:24.421
Thank you for everything.

00:24:26.298 --> 00:24:27.299
You're the best!

00:24:33.221 --> 00:24:38.310
Seriously. No one will think you're weak
if you cry at a time like this.

00:24:38.393 --> 00:24:39.478
What do you mean?

00:24:39.561 --> 00:24:41.271
If you're crying, I could--

00:24:41.354 --> 00:24:42.272
I refuse.

00:24:47.277 --> 00:24:48.820
You're so stubborn.

00:24:48.904 --> 00:24:49.779
Headstrong.

00:24:50.906 --> 00:24:51.948
Be quiet.
